      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like everything i touch gets messed up. i look at my family and i see how much they struggle just trying to deal with my bullshit and the mistakes i keep making. it feels like im just dragging everyone down with me. i dont want to be like this anymore... i just want everyone to be able to breathe again without me being the thing that makes it hard.",
